{
  "key": 19959,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Welcome",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the Universal Pokémon\n",
        "Medical Center!\r",
        "Shall we look after your Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_RightAway",
      "en_US": "Right away!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_AllBetter",
      "en_US": [
        "All better!\n",
        "Take care of them out there!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chansey",
      "en_US": "Chansey: Chaaan-sey!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_gText_HowMayIServeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome!\r",
        "How may I serve you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_gText_PleaseComeAgain",
      "en_US": "Please come again!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TriageAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re swamped in the Er today!\r",
        "Could you help? Read each patient’s\n",
        "chart and give it the right\f",
        "medicine.\r",
        "Don’t worry, we’ll supply the\n",
        "medicine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart0",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Psyduck\r",
        "Red, blistered skin. Too hot to\n",
        "touch. Keeps holding its head."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart1",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Rattata\r",
        "Purple in the face and shivering.\n",
        "Bitten by a Tentacool."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart2",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Pidgey\r",
        "Can’t move a feather. Little\n",
        "sparks crackle off its wings."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart3",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Jigglypuff\r",
        "Sang itself a lullaby and won’t\n",
        "wake up. Snoring loudly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart4",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Charmander\r",
        "Encased in ice up to the tail.\n",
        "Its flame is barely flickering!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Chart5",
      "en_US": [
        "Patient Chart: Spinda\r",
        "Walking in circles, bumping into\n",
        "things. More than usual, even."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_OldMan",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon ate something off the\n",
        "floor of the S.S. Anne again.\r",
        "Third time this month!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Girl",
      "en_US": [
        "Happiny’s here to visit the\n",
        "Chansey! It wants to be a nurse\f",
        "when it grows up."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Happiny",
      "en_US": "Happiny: Happi! Happi!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Woman",
      "en_US": [
        "The wait’s not bad at all.\n",
        "They see you right away here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Youngster",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m not sick. I just come to watch\n",
        "the Chansey work. They’re so fast!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Cabinet",
      "en_US": [
        "Rows and rows of medicine.\n",
        "Everything’s neatly labeled."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Plaque",
      "en_US": [
        "Universal Pokémon Medical Center\n",
        "Reception"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TakeCare",
      "en_US": "Take care!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TriageThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "The Er’s never run so smoothly!\n",
        "Thanks again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TriageDone",
      "en_US": [
        "You treated every one of them!\n",
        "Thank you so much!\r",
        "Please, take these."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TriageUpstairs",
      "en_US": [
        "The wards upstairs could use a\n",
        "hand, too. It’s chaos up there!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_PatientHappy",
      "en_US": "It’s resting happily."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_GiveWhich",
      "en_US": "Give it which medicine?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_BurnHeal",
      "en_US": "Burn Heal"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Antidote",
      "en_US": "Antidote"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_ParlyzHeal",
      "en_US": "Parlyz Heal"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_Awakening",
      "en_US": "Awakening"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_IceHeal",
      "en_US": "Ice Heal"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_PersimBerry",
      "en_US": "Persim Berry"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TreatRight",
      "en_US": "It looks much better!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_TreatWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Uh-oh… That didn’t help at all!\n",
        "Better read the chart again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_VermilionCity_MedicalCenter_1F_Text_AllTreated",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s every patient treated!\n",
        "The triage nurse looks impressed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0972_CV_CANVAS_MEDICAL_CENTER_1F_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
